
Creates a new instance and sets the property values for the new instance.
USAGE:

CREATE <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

NOTE: Create cannot be used to create a new class.

The following properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
AccessMask                         	N/A                 	N/A       
Comment                            	N/A                 	N/A       
ConnectionState                    	N/A                 	N/A       
ConnectionType                     	N/A                 	N/A       
Description                        	N/A                 	N/A       
DisplayType                        	N/A                 	N/A       
InstallDate                        	N/A                 	N/A       
LocalName                          	N/A                 	N/A       
Name                               	N/A                 	N/A       
Persistent                         	N/A                 	N/A       
ProviderName                       	N/A                 	N/A       
RemoteName                         	N/A                 	N/A       
RemotePath                         	N/A                 	N/A       
ResourceType                       	N/A                 	N/A       
Status                             	N/A                 	N/A       
UserName                           	N/A                 	N/A       

